    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11780" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεκ-δέχομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>expect anxiously, await eagerly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωτῆρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Phil.</u>
					3.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάνατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μέλλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					2.35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				2.73
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>misunderstand, misinterpret,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hipparch.
				1.6.11
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>understand</i> a word <i>from</i> the context, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Conj.</u>
				226.20
			</span></i>.</div>
